---
---
  <section class="chapter" id="rebirth" aria-labelledby="h-rebirth">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="ch-head">
        <div class="ch-tag"><span class="num">CH.II</span><span class="rule"></span><span class="name">Rebirth</span></div>
        <h2 id="h-rebirth" data-scramble>Paper in. Clean data out.</h2>
        <p>We build systems around the tools you already run: your TMS, your accounting system, your inbox and your spreadsheets. A person approves anything that leaves the building.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="transform">
        <div class="bol" aria-label="Example bill of lading being read">
          <div class="scanline" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="bol-head"><b>BILL OF LADING</b><span>Incoming · PDF scan</span></div>
          <div class="bol-grid">
            <div class="fld" data-f="0"><small>B/L NO.</small>SAMPLE-000124</div>
            <div class="fld" data-f="1"><small>VESSEL / VOYAGE</small>EXAMPLE STAR / 042N</div>
            <div class="fld" data-f="2"><small>PORT OF LOADING</small>Santos, BR</div>
            <div class="fld" data-f="3"><small>PORT OF DISCHARGE</small>Miami, FL</div>
            <div class="fld" data-f="4"><small>CONTAINERS</small>2 × 40' HC</div>
            <div class="fld" data-f="5"><small>GROSS WEIGHT</small>18,420 KG</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <svg class="arrow" width="64" height="24" viewBox="0 0 64 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12 H58 M48 3 L60 12 L48 21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="14" cy="12" r="2.5" fill="currentColor"/><circle cx="28" cy="12" r="2.5" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
        <div class="log" aria-label="What the system does with it">
          <div class="row" data-r="0"><span>Fields extracted and cross-checked</span><span class="ok">✓ 6 / 6</span></div>
          <div class="row" data-r="1"><span>Shipment record created</span><span class="ok">✓ Posted to TMS</span></div>
          <div class="row" data-r="2"><span>Customer ETA email drafted</span><span class="ok">✓ Ready to review</span></div>
          <div class="row" data-r="3"><span>Weight vs. packing list</span><span class="warn">! Flagged for ops</span></div>
          <p class="note">Illustrative example with sample data.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="systems">
        <article class="sys">
          <div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 2 H15 L20 7 V22 H6 Z"/><path d="M15 2 V7 H20"/><path d="M9 12 H17 M9 16 H17"/></svg></div>
          <span class="tag">System 01</span>
          <h3>Document extraction</h3>
          <p>Reads shipping documents, checks them against each other, and enters the data where it belongs.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="sys">
          <div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14"/><path d="M2 7 L12 14 L22 7"/></svg></div>
          <span class="tag">System 02</span>
          <h3>Quote desk assistant</h3>
          <p>Pulls rate requests out of email, prices them from your tariffs, and drafts the reply for your team to send.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="sys">
          <div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7 V12 L16 14"/></svg></div>
          <span class="tag">System 03</span>
          <h3>Status &amp; customer updates</h3>
          <p>Tracks shipments across carriers and keeps customers informed, escalating only the exceptions.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="sys">
          <div class="ic"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 21 H21"/><path d="M6 18 V12 M11 18 V7 M16 18 V10 M20 18 V4"/></svg></div>
          <span class="tag">System 04</span>
          <h3>Ops dashboards</h3>
          <p>One live view of volume, bottlenecks and margins, pulled from the systems you already have.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
